    "# R Concatenate Elements\n",
    "\n",
    "## Concatenate Elements\n",
    "\n",
    "You can also concatenate, or join, two or more elements, by using the paste() function.\n",
    "\n",
    "To combine both text and a variable, R uses comma (,):"
